{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_008_03_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8d16fd07c45f3250a779fa1c07845eb79a27c06491e4fb222e41e1312c0fcfb5",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:890e4ffccbb4703e4c719ac629ac70ce4b89b053030a846ce611e02191e6c1e9",
      "text": "……唔——……\n……不行，感觉不对！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5707bb9d190f36e13132fff5bf9834a85324746f42c43013c808bb0bf7badfc1",
      "text": "……呜呜，卷子上写的数学公式看起来像咒语\n一样了～！脑子都要爆炸了！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_d:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6691d141dc281e43f5204d91132df487204e657f41cf1267c86fd3784e9650bd",
      "text": "隼人也是，四季也是……加油……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_d:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7349592bd6449ec2f69d1d7cf74d8eced486b5cd50ddb5462d7e31c78d273376",
      "text": "（隼人宁愿睡眠不足也要写歌，\n却好像没什么进展……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_d:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6143e7a6aae924a46f0e0fdfd521fedfa736637153ca47868181642078f9db1f",
      "text": "（四季君为了讨厌到要逃考的学习，\n拼得头顶都快冒烟了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_d:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9615063837b7b6b9c030cc2c0d1f624396b4c005e0ec83ffd608b6f7f0486fa",
      "text": "（有必要这么拼命吗……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_d:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92f434fffb1cf691c07fa750c6fe859bd9ca9a7e7ea6ea9c620f9cb66f75e8d4",
      "text": "（大家为什么能为了社团，做到这种地步……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_d:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afbd2a46dc781fdbc8a01e89d896c74ab0b635abffe8db415cd8b349347a8826",
      "text": "旬亲～，这里能再给我\n讲一遍吗～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_d:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b946c7b645112ccd54254e93d2c8157aa6b450e951872e004aa21db7cf67d38",
      "text": "唉，真是的……拿你没办法。\n听好了？这里是……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
